    <string name="mode_auto">Auto</string>
    <string name="mode_auto_tag">Slow · ~3× longer</string>
    <string name="mode_auto_desc">Po sets itself verifiable goals and keeps working until they pass. Measured: no more accurate than Builder, about 3 times slower and 2 to 10 times more tokens. Keep it for a long task left unattended whose result can be checked (tests, a command). Sensitive actions ask for your approval.</string>
    <string name="mode_auto_bypass">Auto · bypass</string>
    <string name="mode_auto_bypass_desc">Like auto, at the same cost, without any approval request for the whole session. For a long unattended task, in a project you can restore.</string>
